<p>What does a private Ayodhya tour cost if you want to visit Shri Ram Janmabhoomi Mandir, Hanuman Garhi, Kanak Bhawan and the Saryu riverfront without organising every transfer yourself? The answer depends mainly on how many days you have, how many people are travelling and whether you are beginning in Ayodhya or arriving from another city.</p>
<p><strong>Our published Ayodhya tour prices start from {{price:/tours/ayodhya-tour-in-one-day/}} per person for one day, {{price:/tours/ayodhya-tour-in-two-days/}} for two days and {{price:/tours/ayodhya-tour-in-three-days/}} for three days.</strong> Each rate includes GST and is based on at least two guests. These are private ground-tour starting prices, not hotel-inclusive holiday packages.</p>
<h2>Ayodhya private tour package cost at a glance</h2>
<p>These starting prices apply to a locally planned Ayodhya programme on regular dates. The final amount may change with the arrival point, group size, vehicle, festival dates and confirmed temple arrangements.</p>
