<h2>What is included in our Ayodhya tour price?</h2>
<ul>
<li>Private local transport for the confirmed itinerary and agreed sightseeing duties.</li>
<li>An experienced local guide to explain the temples and help coordinate the day's sequence.</li>
<li>Listed local transfers, entrance and darshan-related arrangements included in the chosen tour, where permissible and specifically confirmed.</li>
